# Controller credentials — copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in.
# run_controller.py passes this file to the daemon via env_file, so the
# a11y-controller profile's `api_key: "${JAATO_DOUBLEWORD_API_KEY}"` resolves.
#
# Get a Doubleword key from https://app.doubleword.ai/api-keys
#
# NOTE: the profile previously referenced the key as a `pass://` secret URI.
# That scheme is resolved only by the private jaato-premium package and fails
# SILENTLY on a public checkout (jaato logs a warning, then sends the literal
# URI string to the provider as the API key). Use the env-var form below.
JAATO_DOUBLEWORD_API_KEY=
